<title>SPAIN: Spain's April trade deficit at 278.7 bln pta. [CORRECTED 10:25 GMT]</title>
<headline>Spain's April trade deficit at 278.7 bln pta. [CORRECTED 10:25 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The customs department of the</p>
<p>Economy Ministry gave the following figures (billions of</p>
<p>pesetas):</p>
<p> TRADE BALANCE		APR 97	MAR 97	 APR 96</p>
<p> Exports		    1,357.1	1,291.9	 1,097.1</p>
<p>(Corrects Apr 97 exports figure from 1,635.8 to 1,357.1)</p>
<p> Imports		    1,635.8	1,410.5	 1.342.4</p>
<p>(Corrects Apr 97 imports figure from 1,357.1 to 1,635.8)</p>
<p> Deficit/surplus	   -278.7	 -118.7	  -245.3</p>
<p> Def/surplus yr to date  -749.9	 -471.3	  -849.7</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are customs-cleared data.</p>
</text>
